    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεκ-δύομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δύσομαι [ῡ</span>]: aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εδῡσάμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip off oneself</i>: metaph.,
				<i>put off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν παλαιὸν ἄνθρωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Col.</u>
					3.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>strip off for oneself, despoil,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.15
			</span></i>.</div>
